REGENT OF SUKOHARJO

REGENT OF SUKOHARJO

REGIONAL REGULATION OF SUKOHARJO REGENCY

NUMBER 6 OF 2011

CONCERNING

THE PROVISION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF

GENDER-BASED AND CHILD VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF SUKOHARJO,

Considering : a. that all forms of violence, especially gender-based and child violence, constitute violations of human rights and crimes against human dignity as well as forms of discrimination;

b. that victims of gender-based and child violence must receive protection from both the regional government and/or the community in order to avoid and be free from violence and/or threats of violence within the household and community;

c. that based on Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection and Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence, the Regional Government together with the community is obligated to undertake prevention, protection, and recovery efforts for victims of gender-based and child violence;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a, b and c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Provision of Protection for Victims of Gender-Based and Child Violence;

In view of : 1. Law Number 13 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions within the Province of Central Java;

2. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);

